e last thing you ordered me to do."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then did we... successfully intercept the Sangvis cargo?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've acquired a lot of intel."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So we did fail..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's there to be upset about? Your team didn't get completely wiped out. Your worst fear has not come to life."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Still... I can't seem to get over it at all..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Keep lying in there for all you want. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As the humans are so fond of telling each other, \"Sleep. In your dreams, anything is possible.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dream... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AUG... I actually... just had a dream."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Allow me to remind you that T-Dolls cannot dream. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I believe the proper term for it was \"computational tests that the Neural Cloud undergoes during reconfiguration\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know it wasn't real! Cut me some slack, okay?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mhmm? So what did you dream about? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A sea of flowers in full bloom or World War IV?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It wasn't anything that grand... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My dream was probably about... another possible outcome of our most recent mission..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So your neural cloud was actively trying to figure out what could be worse than being helpless as Sangvis Ferri plans to massacre people by the millions?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have you experienced something like this before?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I never need to. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sentences that start with an \"if\" serve no purpose other than grate on the ears."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) I even promised the Commander I wouldn't return empty-handed before we set off... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I just can't let it all go so easily like you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have nothing to say if the victories in your dreams bring you satisfaction."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dreamland is a place where you can have it all without losing anything. A true marvel to behold... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But a wholly unrealistic one."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's good that you're back from there. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Now with your feet firmly grounded in reality, it's time that I give you some bad news to strike at your heart, dear leader."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UgUgh... I don't want to hear any of it... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We've never had a mission turn out so disastrously before. I don't want to know what the others are saying about us... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Especially that... nasty anonymous dissing forum or something..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is it that you want?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone has collected so much intel about this crisis, but we can't even find the cargo..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So do you want to find this legendary weapon of mass destruction, or do you think it's better if we never find it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What I want... is to do whatever possible to prevent Sangvis Ferri from wreaking havoc with such a devastating weapon... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For the sake of those who we've sworn to protect... and ourselves."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Spoken just like the leader of a team which was nearly wiped out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"See to it that you can uphold such an oath before speaking of such things. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, by the way, here's a perfunctory reminder that we have just received our next mission."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh...? Wait. I literally just woke up in the repair bay..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Did I also mention that while we were having this conversation, the Commander was having an emergency meeting with all the team leaders?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why didn't you tell me something this important?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You couldn't have made it anyway. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The discussion we had about dreams was also very interesting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even if I couldn't have made it, we can't just not go entirely! I thought the vice-leader could attend in my place?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I left early. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As a member on the team that screwed up their mission, my only purpose is to convey the Commander's commendation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commendation...? For what? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Are you making fun of me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just told you, didn't I? We acquired a lot of intel."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...What have we... No, AUG... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What did YOU bring back from the mission?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"22","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My team leader's greatest regret."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Glock17","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"G17","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yellowcake?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So the intel brought back by the other teams is true?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ja... AUG's video recording of the sealed container inside of the cargo hold... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Taking the radioactive remains of the convoy into consideration, that is the logical conclusion to come to. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I suppose... we did achieve something during our last mission."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SSG69","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"SSG 69","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? Don't tell me... what we were seeking was a batch of nuclear missiles?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SSG69","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They weren't fully assembled. It was most likely the raw materials, but we don't know for sure what exactly was inside that container. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, taking the recent stalemate that we've had with S.F. into consideration, the Commander cannot rule out the possibility that they are attempting to produce such destructive weapons..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SSG69","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"SSG 69","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, obviously... Biological weapons that would cause epidemics and poison gas are ineffective on us, after all..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Glock17","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"G17","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No need to be so frightened, SSG. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who knows, maybe they're facing some hard times and can only make a living by selling ores."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Enough with this irrelevant discussion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander has just made this information confidential to prevent Dolls like you from panicking."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SSG69","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"SSG 69","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That takes the fun out of everything... Now I can't complain about it to the others... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I even just saw a thread discussing this on the \"Griffin Anonymous Dissing Forum\"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SSG69","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"MDR made the best out of the timing. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But now all that's left on the page is posts hard-selling the advantages of bullpup rifles."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Glock17","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"G17","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You yourself are a bullpup rifle, Fräulein AUG..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fishing for appreciation is something I have no interest in. Whether I'm liked or not by others doesn't concern me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"IWS 2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AUG","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"AUG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"IWS, is there something on my face?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"IWS2000","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"97","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"1.5","